<human_speech><blue>A big board. Remember to zoom out.<\blue><green>The enemy is leashed to its neighbourhood. It will crawl around the ring and never cross the middle. That is its whole strategy.<\green><blue>There is also a passive watcher on the far side. It does not move, and it does not need to.<\blue><green>Something to log while you are out there: in the last batch, one adversary changed its own parameters mid-run. We did not tell it to.<\green><blue>It is probably nothing.<\blue><\human_speech>
